      "normalizedSource": "Set this property to [`SCNReferenceLoadingPolicy.onDemand`](scnreferenceloadingpolicy/ondemand.md) before archiving an [`SCNReferenceNode`](scnreferencenode.md) object if you don’t want that reference node to automatically load its content when unarchived.",
