      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If this property’s value is [`SCNReferenceLoadingPolicy.immediate`](scnreferenceloadingpolicy/immediate.md) (the default), instantiating a reference node from an archive (using the [`NSKeyedUnarchiver`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSKeyedUnarchiver) class) automatically loads the node’s external content.",
